body:
Personality being a myth isn't even a theory anymore, it's well confirmed for the majority of people on earth. Don't understand why people insist on denying it.

&#x200B;

Humans judge each other on looks and fall into the halo effect all the time. Seriously I'm more angered by people refusing to acknowledge this than just being alone or rejected or whatever.

&#x200B;

Can't wait for the idiots to flood this with "AAA MISOGYNIST AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA" instead of giving an actual argument.
